  "instructions": [
    "In a large Dutch oven, melt the butter over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional 1 minute.",
    "Add the sliced fennel and cook until slightly tender, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the shucked oysters, chopped parsley, lemon juice, white wine, chicken broth, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Stir to combine, then reduce heat to low and simmer, covered, for 10 minutes.",
    "Serve the stew hot, garnished with additional parsley if desired."
